Package: phylochemistry
Title: Chemical, Statistical and Sequence Analyses for Integrated Bioanalytical Chemistry
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Lucas", "Busta", email = "bust0037@d.umn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data visualization helpers, statistics verbs, matrix analyses
    (principal components, clustering, distances, networks), predictive models,
    sequence and phylogenetic tools, and the teaching datasets used in the
    'Integrated Bioanalytical Chemistry' course book and the Busta lab.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/thebustalab/phylochemistry
BugReports: https://github.com/thebustalab/phylochemistry/issues
